uary to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, August to September came in at 46% of normal and January to February at 60%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 204% of normal on the middle. Grid 26280 had its driest year in 1963 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
